re, but it would be a good final check.\n3. Temporary files in `/tmp/opencode/` (renders, backups) are outside the workspace and can be ignored/removed.\n\n## Recommended next steps\n\n1. Delete `scripts/overlay.gd` and `scripts/overlay.gd.uid` from `/workspace/scripts/`.\n2. (Optional) Run `timeout 10 godot --path . --quit-after 2` once more to confirm the scene still parses cleanly.\n3. The task requirements themselves (SpawningPoints, SpawnTop, SpawnBot with z_index=1, visually aligned positions) are already satisfied in `scenes/main.tscn`.","time":{"start":1790454349274,"end":1790454349278},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_852acdd7cc40418480c0f64390e7bd01_msg"}}}}
